    affiliation: >-
      Food Science and Technology Laboratories,
      Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology, Ghana
version: 1.0.0-rc.1
date-released: 2026-11-10
url: https://github.com/YadexSolutions/FoodMicroCount-Releases
repository-code: https://github.com/YadexSolutions/FoodMicroCount-Releases
repository-artifact: https://github.com/YadexSolutions/FoodMicroCount-Releases/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.1
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  FoodMicro Count is open-source Windows desktop software for analyst-reviewed
  microbial colony counting, plate-image analysis, editable detection markers,
  quantitative calculations, and result export. Version 1.0.0-rc.1 is a public
  evaluation release; independent laboratory validation is pending.
keywords:
  - microbiology
  - food microbiology
  - colony counting
  - image analysis
  - laboratory software
